    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37527" root="لتأ" body-key="l">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَتَأَه فِى صَدْرِهِ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَتَاَ</span></b> , (K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَتْءٌ</span>,
(TA,) <i>He thrust him on his breast.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَتَأَ</span> <i>He hit, struck,</i> or <i>hurt;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصَابَ</span>. (TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَتَأَ بِسَهْمٍ</span> <i>He shot an arrow.</i> (K, * TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَتَأَهُ بِحَجَرٍ</span> <i>He cast a stone at him.</i> (S, K. *) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَتَأَتْ بِهِ</span> (tropical:)  <i>She</i> (a woman) <i>brought him forth.</i>
(S, K. *) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b6-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَعَنَ اللّٰهُ أُمًّا لَتَأَتْ بِهِ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَكَأَتْ به</span>,
(S,) (tropical:)  <i>God curse the mother that cast him forth</i>
(<i>from her womb</i>) ! a tropical expression, from
casting a stone, or shooting an arrow. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b7- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَتَأَ</span>, (S, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَتْءٌ</span>, (TA,) <i>Inivit</i> feminam.
(S, K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَتَأَ</span> <i>He lessened,</i> or <i>diminished;</i> syn.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَقَصَ</span>. (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>Pepedit.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <i>Excrevit merdam.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <i>He,</i> or <i>it, passed,</i> or <i>went away;</i>
syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَضَى</span>. (CK.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَتَأَ بِعَيْنِهِ</span>, (TA,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لتأ</span>
alone, (K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَتْءٌ</span>, (TA,) <i>He looked intently.</i>
(K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَتَأَهُ بِعَيْنِهِ</span> <i>He looked intently at him.</i>
(S.)

